; SPEP: peptidoglycan residue (CHARMM36 carbohydrate + protein types), free (unlinked) state.
; Used by CG2AT for the fragment bonds and masses; the PG layer topology itself is written by
; at_mod_pg, which applies the glycosidic, stem and cross-link patches to these atoms.
